udio"}, {"widget": {"name": "model_path"}, "name": "model_path", "label": "model_path", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "model_path"}, {"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "link": 83, "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}, {"widget": {"name": "prompt_text"}, "name": "prompt_text", "link": 45, "label": "prompt_text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt_text"}, {"widget": {"name": "steps"}, "name": "steps", "label": "steps", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "steps"}, {"widget": {"name": "guidance_strength"}, "name": "guidance_strength", "label": "guidance_strength", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "guidance_strength"}, {"widget": {"name": "guidance_method"}, "name": "guidance_method", "label": "guidance_method", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "guidance_method"}, {"widget": {"name": "device"}, "name": "device", "label": "device", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "device"}, {"widget": {"name": "dtype"}, "name": "dtype", "label": "dtype", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "dtype"}, {"widget": {"name": "attention"}, "name": "attention", "label": "attention", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "attention"}, {"widget": {"name": "seed"}, "name": "seed", "label": "seed", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "seed"}, {"widget": {"name": "keep_model_loaded"}, "name": "keep_model_loaded", "label": "keep_model_loaded", "type": "BOOLEAN", "localized_name": "keep_model_loaded"}], "flags": {}, "id": 3, "type": "LongCatVoiceCloneTTS", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "LongCatVoiceCloneTTS"}, "order": 36}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#c09430", "widgets_values": ["# LongCat AudioDiT 文本转语音\n\n\n---\n\n\n| 模型名称 | 显存占用 | 下载大小 |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| LongCat-AudioDiT-3.5B-bf16 (推荐) | ~12GB | ~7GB |\n| LongCat-AudioDiT-3.5B-fp8 | ~8GB | ~4GB |\n| LongCat-AudioDiT-3.5B (fp32) | ~20GB | ~14GB |\n\n---\n\n\n## 核心节点说明\n| 节点名称 | 核心功能 |\n| :--- | :--- |\n| **LongCat AudioDiT TTS** | 纯文本转高清语音输出 |\n| **LongCat AudioDiT Voice Clone TTS** | 音色克隆：基于 3-15 秒参考音频复刻音色 |\n| **LongCat AudioDiT Multi-Speaker TTS** | 对话生成：支持多角色 `[speaker_N]` 标签切换 |\n\n---\n\n## 参数配置指南\n| 参数 | 默认值 | 功能说明 |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| **steps** | 16 | ODE 欧拉求解步数 (推荐 4-64) |\n| **guidance_strength** | 4.0 | 引导系数 (CFG/APG)，影响声音表现力 |\n| **guidance_method** | cfg / apg | 纯文字合成选 **cfg**；音色克隆建议选 **apg** |\n| **dtype** | auto | 运行精度：bf16, fp16, fp32 |\n| **attention** | auto | 加速算子：sdpa, sage_attention, flash_attention |\n| **keep_model_loaded** | true | 模型常驻显存，减少二次加载等待 |\n\n---\n\n## 进阶技巧：音色克隆\n1. 连接参考音频（3-15秒）至 `prompt_audio` 输入端。\n2. **关键步骤**：使用 **Qwen3-ASR** 提取文字，并配合 **ForcedAligner** 节点进行时序对齐，输入给 `prompt_text`。\n3. 这样做可以显著消除背景杂音，并让 AI 精准捕捉参考音频中的停顿与重音。\n\n---\n\n## 安装方法与仓库地址\n\n### 1. LongCat AudioDIT TTS 核心插件\n* **仓库地址**：[https://github.com/Saganaki22/ComfyUI-LongCat-AudioDIT-TTS](https://github.com/Saganaki22/ComfyUI-LongCat-AudioDIT-TTS)\n* **安装方式**：\n  * 进入 `ComfyUI/custom_nodes/` 目录。\n  * 执行 `git clone https://github.com/Saganaki22/ComfyUI-LongCat-AudioDIT-TTS.git`。\n\n### 2. Qwen3-ASR 增强插件 (用于克隆转录)\n* **仓库地址**：[https://github.com/shumoLR/Comfyui_SynVow_Qwen3ASR](https://github.com/shumoLR/Comfyui_SynVow_Qwen3ASR)\n* **安装方式**：\n  * 在 **ComfyUI-Manager** 中通过 `Install via Git URL` 安装，或在 `custom_nodes` 目录下执行 `git clone https://github.com/shumoLR/Comfyui_SynVow_Qwen3ASR.git`。"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "rgba(24,24,27,.9)", "size": [525.1848754882812, 1691.309814453125], "pos": [-4430.6298828125, 467.9337158203125], "id": 25, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 5}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "AUDIO", "links": [76], "label": "音频", "type": "AUDIO", "localized_name": "音频"}], "size": [413.18017578125, 136], "pos": [-1028.0889892578125, 571.9447021484375], "widgets_values": ["fae81ebe3ecb7d000559fc8589655dc25a524106635beab615375acff0702c3b.mp3", null, null], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "audio"}, "name": "audio", "label": "audio", "type": "CO